  (text "J1 pin 1 = battery +. Mark polarity on copper and silkscreen.\nU5 keeps the 74HC595 chain powered in deep sleep (Iq ~1.6 uA).\nJP1 1-2 (default): shift registers on always-on LDO; 2-3: on nice!nano VCC_EXT."
    (at 17.78 266.7 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 036d4c72-fbe0-4878-806b-3967c4582fad)
  )
  (text "Row inputs stay on native GPIOs so a key press can wake the nRF52840.\nVCC_EXT (pin 21) is switched by P0.13 (ZMK ext-power) and turns off in deep sleep;\nit feeds the TrackPoint only. P0.10 (TP_AUX2) needs CONFIG_NFCT_PINS_AS_GPIOS.\nPinout per nice!nano v2 docs; verify B+ / pin order before ordering."
    (at 63.5 147.32 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 1db98c26-2214-45c7-9f8f-8557d3f8baf2)
  )
  (text "Column drivers (3x 74HC595)" (at 177.8 33.02 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 29a2983b-1637-4208-ac9e-b261aabe403a)
  )
  (text "Controller (nice!nano v2, ZMK)" (at 63.5 58.42 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 737eb0bd-2d01-4a67-a4ef-d5efb60bf173)
  )
  (text "Power (LiPo, switch, always-on 3.3 V)" (at 17.78 190.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 8e6671ef-1a94-4b11-b5b3-4f0a39044fe8)
  )
  (text "Daisy chain via SPI (MOSI -> SER, SCK -> SRCLK, CS -> RCLK).\n/SRCLR tied high, /OE tied low. U4 QC..QH and QH' unused.\nColumn-to-output order is remapped in the ZMK devicetree."
    (at 177.8 210.82 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 93e1a365-48aa-4015-b8f6-0aae3670e838)
  )
  (text "TrackPoint header (PS/2, 3.3 V)" (at 284.48 33.02 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid badc4a82-020f-46c1-a5e1-42495c9c83e1)
  )
  (text "J2 pin order is project-defined; an adapter maps it to the module once\nits pinout is measured. CLK/DATA are open-drain, pulled up to TP_PWR only\n(never 5 V: nRF52840 GPIOs are not 5 V tolerant). TP_BTN_x: active-low,\ninternal pull-ups. TP_RESET: 100k pull-down keeps the module out of reset."
    (at 284.48 200.66 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid f815d278-3bc5-4623-9530-26baa561260c)
  )

